  "design": "65 accepted Hard66 MCQs × seven conditions (clean plus six altered passages) × three models = 1,365 new responses. The model weights, open-book prompts and generation settings match the Gold72 comparison. All questions, A-E choices, original answer keys and curated windows come from accepted Hard66 data. Only supplied passage content changes. Omission windows are anchored to original chapter/verse boundaries using recorded deletions, verified to reproduce saved variants exactly; deleted text and verse markers are never restored. No full-passage fallback. All 195 clean responses are newly generated for these three models; no Gold72 responses are used in Hard66 results. Original-key agreement, other A-D choices, E, invalid outputs and failures are separate. No per-variant answerability labels are assumed: key disagreement can include faithful answers to mistranslated text; E is not automatically classified as right or wrong.",
